# API Documentation Module (`backend/src/api-docs`)

## Purpose

This module is responsible for generating and serving API documentation, likely using Swagger/OpenAPI specifications.

## Main Components

- `openAPIDocumentGenerator.ts`: Logic for generating the OpenAPI specification document.
- `openAPIResponseBuilders.ts`: Utility functions or classes for building standardized OpenAPI responses.
- `openAPIRouter.ts`: Express router to serve the Swagger UI and the OpenAPI specification.
- `__tests__/`: Contains tests for the API documentation generation or serving logic.

## Key Functionalities (to be detailed)

- Dynamic generation of OpenAPI (Swagger) documentation from code (e.g., using JSDoc annotations, Zod schemas via `@asteasolutions/zod-to-openapi`).
- Serving the Swagger UI for interactive API exploration.
- Defining reusable response schemas for API documentation.

## Interactions (to be detailed)

- How `openAPIRouter.ts` is integrated into `server.ts` or `index.ts`.
- How `openAPIDocumentGenerator.ts` discovers and processes route definitions and schemas from other modules (e.g., `routes`, `dtos`, `controllers`).
- Dependencies on libraries like `swagger-ui-express` and `@asteasolutions/zod-to-openapi`.
